          <a href="#nausea" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Nausea-Friendly Choices</a>
          <a href="#fluids-fiber" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Fluids, Fiber and Constipation</a>
          <a href="#strength-training" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Pair It With Strength Training</a>
          <a href="#talk-to-your-prescriber" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. When to Check With Your Prescriber</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Common Mistakes</a>
