          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            On a GLP-1 medication, the job of a protein shake is narrow but important: deliver 20 to 30 g of protein in the smallest, gentlest serving your stomach will accept, on the days food alone falls short. A dense ready-to-drink shake like Fairlife Nutrition Plan, a cold clear whey for nausea, a thin-mixing isolate and an unflavored powder for fortifying food cover almost every situation.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
